, commercial or otherwise, without acknowledgement or compensation to you, including to develop, copy, publish, or improve the Feedback or Services, or to improve or develop new products, services, or technologies in ElevenLabs’ sole discretion. ElevenLabs will exclusively own any improvements to, or new inventions based upon, such Services, or Services based on the Feedback. You understand that ElevenLabs may treat any Feedback as nonconfidential.\"}]]}]}]\nbb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"46\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"6. Subscription Services; Payment\"}]}]]}]}]\nbc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"47\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(a) Subscriptions.\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" To access and use certain Services, you may be required to enroll in a subscription payment plan (a “\"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Recurring Subscription\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"3\",{\"children\":\"”). Your Recurring Subscription will automatically renew until you cancel it or your Recurring Subscription is otherwise terminated. You authorize us to store your payment method information and to automatically charge your payment method(s) for the amount of your Recurring Subscription with no further action required by you. The length of your Recurring Subscription will be provided when you make your purchase. In the event that ElevenLabs is unable to charge your payment method(s) as authorized by you when you enrolled in a Recurring Subscription, ElevenLabs may in its sole discretion (i) suspend your access to the Services until payment is received or (ii) seek to update your payment method information through third-party sources (i.e., your bank or a payment processor) to continue charging your payment method as authorized by you. We will notify you before taking any of these actions.\"}]]}]}]\nbd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"48\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(b) Prepaid Credits. \"}]}]]}]}]\nbe:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"49\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(i)\"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\" Overview and Nature of Prepaid Credits. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"ElevenLabs may offer prepaid usage credits (“\"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Prepaid Credits\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"”) for certain Services or Accounts. Prepaid Credits are a limited, revocable, prepaid right to access Services, are not money or a monetary equivalent, and do not constitute a deposit, stored value, or balance held for your benefit, nor do they create any fiduciary or custodial relationship. \"}]]}]}]\nbf:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"50\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(ii) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Promotional Credits. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"From time to time, ElevenLabs may issue Prepaid Credits without charge as part of a promotional, marketing, or trial program (“\"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"3\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Promotional Credits\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4\",{\"children\":\"”). Promotional Credits are subject to these Terms unless otherwise expressly stated at the time of issuance and may be subject to additional restrictions, including limitations on use, expiration, or eligibility.\"}]]}]}]\nc0:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"51\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(iii) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Purchase of Prepaid Credits. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Prepaid Credits may be purchased through your Account under Section 6, either as a one-time purchase or via recurring purchase. ElevenLabs may impose purchase limits, and Prepaid Credits are issued upon successful payment. If you elect to enable recurring purchase, you authorize ElevenLabs to automatically charge your saved Payment Method and add additional Prepaid Credits to your Account when your available Prepaid Credits balance falls below the threshold you select. The recurring purchase will continue until you disable the feature or your Account is terminated in accordance with these Terms.\"}]]}]}]\nc1:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"52\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(iv) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Use of Prepaid Credits. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Prepaid Credits may be used only to pay for eligible Services as expressly permitted by ElevenLabs and solely in connection with your Account. The rate at which Prepaid Credits are applied to Services may vary depending on your Recurring Subscription and the pricing applicable to your use of the Services at the time of use. Prepaid Credits may not be transferred, sold, gifted, traded, sublicensed, or assigned, whether for value or otherwise, and any purported transfer is void.\"}]]}]}]\nc2:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"53\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(v) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Account Balance and Responsibility. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Your available Prepaid Credits balance is viewable through your Account, and you are solely responsible for verifying all Prepaid Credits additions and deductions. Your Prepaid Credits balance is not a bank account, digital wallet, stored value account, or other payment device.\"}]]}]}]\nc3:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"54\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(vi) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Expiration of Prepaid Credits. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Unless otherwise specified at the time of purchase or issuance, all Prepaid Credits expire twelve (12) months after the date of purchase or issuance, as applicable. Expired Prepaid Credits are automatically removed from your Account and may not be reinstated. ElevenLabs has no obligation to provide notice prior to the expiration of Prepaid Credits.\"}]]}]}]\nc4:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"55\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(vii) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"No Refunds; Final Sale. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Except where required by applicable law, Prepaid Credits purchases are non-refundable, and no refunds or credits will be provided for unused, partially used, expired, or forfeited Prepaid Credits. Unused Prepaid Credits are not refundable upon Account suspension or termination.\"}]]}]}]\nc5:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"56\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(viii) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Prohibited Transfers and Misuse. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"ElevenLabs does not permit or recognize the sale, transfer, gift, trade, or exchange of Prepaid Credits. Any such attempt constitutes a material breach and may result, at ElevenLabs’ discretion, in cancellation or forfeiture of Prepaid Credits or termination of your Account without refund.\"}]]}]}]\nc6:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"57\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(ix) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Changes to Prepaid Credits Terms. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"ElevenLabs may modify Prepaid Credits pricing, usage rates, expiration periods, or eligible Services under Section 14. Such changes apply prospectively and will not reduce the remaining validity of purchased Prepaid Credits, except as required by law or for fraud prevention, security, or legal compliance.\"}]]}]}]\nc7:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"58\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"(x) \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"Effect of Account Termination. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":\"Upon suspension or termination of your Account for any reason, including under Section 14, any unused Prepaid Credits remaining in your Account will be forfeited without refund, except where required by applicable law.\"}]]}]}]\nc8:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"59\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(c) Cancellation. You may cancel your subscription through your account, by getting in touch with us or, depending on your location, by any additional cancellation mechanisms we may provide. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"You may cancel a Recurring Subscription at any time, but the cancellation only becomes effective at the end of the current billing period (except where you have cancelled due to a valid reason, e.g., an upcoming change to the Terms (as set out in the introductory wording to these Terms above) or in relation to exercising your withdrawal rights, as set out in Section 7). Except as stated in the foregoing sentence, we will not refund any subscription fees already paid to us. Following any cancellation, however, you will continue to have access to the applicable Services through the end of your current subscription period.\"}]]}]}]\nc9:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"60\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(d) Price Changes.\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" If you are based in the UK or any country other than Germany in the EEA, we reserve the right to change the price for the Recurring Subscription from time to time. If you purchased your Recurring Subscription directly from us, we will give you at least 30 days’ notice of any price changes; if you do not want to continue your Recurring Subscription at the new price, you can cancel your Recurring Subscription before the start of the next subscription period. If you do not cancel your Recurring Subscription before the start of the next subscription period, you will be deemed to have accepted the price change. If you purchased your Recurring Subscription through an app store, price changes may be treated differently. Please review the relevant App Store Terms for further information.\"}]]}]}]\nca:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"61\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(e) Other Usage Charges.\"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":\" In the event your usage exceeds the volume provided under your Recurring Subscription, you will be charged usage overage fees for your Recurring Subscription, as indicated to you upon subscribing. In such event, you hereby authorize us to charge your payment method on file or any other payment method you choose for these charges.\"}]]}]}]\ncb:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"62\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(f) Payment. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"You represent and warrant that you have the right to use any payment method that you submit in connection with a payment. We may receive updated information from your issuing bank or our payment service provider about any payment method you have stored with us. You authorize us to charge your payment method, including any updated payment method information we receive, for any charges you are responsible for under these Terms. Verification of information may be required prior to the acknowledgment or completion of any transaction. You will pay all charges incurred by you or on your behalf through the Services, at the prices in effect when such charges are incurred, including all taxes and shipping and handling charges applicable to your transactions. In the event legal action is necessary to collect on balances due, and to the extent permitted under applicable law, you will reimburse us and our vendors or agents for all expenses incurred to recover sums due, including attorneys’ fees and other legal expenses.\"}]]}]}]\ncc:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"63\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"7. Right of withdrawal\"}]}]]}]}]\n12e:T402,When you purchase a Recurring Subscription directly from us as a consumer, you have a legal right to withdraw from your Recurring Subscription agreement with us within 14 days of purchase. Instructions on how to exercise this right, the consequences of exercising this right (including details of any amounts owed to us for the period from the beginning of your agreement up to and including the day prior to your exercise of your right of withdrawal) and a model form that you can use to exercise your right to withdraw are set out at the end of these Terms in Appendix 1. When you purchase a Recurring Subscription, you expressly acknowledge and agree to the immediate provision of the Recurring Subscription. You understand that if you change your mind within the first 14 days, you may withdraw from the agreement for a refund. When you purchase a Recurring Subscription through an app store provider, your right of withdrawal may be treated differently. Please review the relevant app store terms for further information.cd:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"64\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"$12e\"}]]}]}]\nce:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"65\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"8. Copyright Complaints\"}]}]]}]}]\ncf:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"66\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"content-element\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontWeight\":\"bold\"},\"children\":\"(a) Reporting Claims of Copyright Infringement. \"}]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1\",{\"children\":\"ElevenLabs takes claims of intellectual property infringement very seriously. The best way to report content on our Services that you believe may infringe your copyrights is by reporting it \"}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"a\",null,